#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trademasters"
msgstr "Mestres do comercio"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginians were broadly known for their extensive trade over the "
"Mediterranean Sea."
msgstr "Os cartaxineses eran amplamente coñecidos polo seu extenso comercio polo mar Mediterráneo."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trade ships are available in the Village Phase."
msgstr "Os barcos mercantes están dispoñibles na Fase da Aldea."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Mining Economy"
msgstr "Economía mineira"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginian economy was centered around mining, with stone comprising "
"much of Carthage's structures."
msgstr "A economía cartaxinesa centrábase na minería, e a pedra constituía gran parte das estruturas de Cartago."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Stone mining technologies are free and instant."
msgstr "As tecnoloxías de extracción de pedra son gratuítas e instantáneas."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Numidian Cavalry"
msgstr "Cabaleiro númida"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Numidian cavalry's horses, ancestors of the Berber horse, were small "
"compared with other horses of the era, and were well adapted for faster "
"movement over long distances."
msgstr "Os cabalos da cabalería númida, antepasados do cabalo Bérber, eran pequenos en comparación con outros cabalos da época, e estaban ben adaptados para moverse máis rápido a longas distancias."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Cavalry Javelineers +10% walk speed."
msgstr "Lanzador de xavelinas a cabalo: +10 % de velocidade ao camiñar."

